{
  "description": "From v1-edge-ingest/001-add-error-responses.patch.json: Add observed error responses to the v1 edge-ingest operation. Live probes against api.axiom.co showed: 400 for invalid dataset name, 404 when the dataset does not exist, and 422 when the payload body is missing.",
  "patches": [
    {
